model year: 2027
AUD price: $1,079.99
status: Preorder
estimated availability: May 1, 2026
available lengths: 153cm, 156cm, 159cm, 158cm Wide, 161cm Wide, 164cm Wide, 167cm Wide
board type: All Mountain
flex: 6/10
rider level: Intermediate
shape: Directional Twin
camber type: Medium Camber with 3BT and SideKick, Low Nose Sidebase Uplift and Low Tail Sidebase Uplift
base technology: Triple Base Technology (3BT) (reduces risk of edge-catch while maintaining ollie power and carving control)
SideKick technology: Amplifies sidebase uplift beyond widest points of nose and tail, giving tips a hull-like shape for enhanced float in deep snow and smoother turn initiation
nose sidebase uplift: Low
tail sidebase uplift: Low
width options: Standard, Wide
mounting pattern: 2x4 Inserts
laminate: Tri-Ax, Carbon Stringers, D.R.S.T. SuperTubes
laminate detail - Tri-Ax: Tri-Axial fiberglass for maximum strength, minimal weight, and exceptional responsiveness
laminate detail - Carbon Stringers: Strategically placed to fine-tune flex, response, and overall feel
laminate detail - D.R.S.T. SuperTubes: Six hollow carbon cylinders running along sidecut radius to increase power and response to edges, enhance camber, reduce weight, and increase pop
core: Ultra Light Core (1:2 blend of Poplar and Paulownia for excellent strength to weight ratio)
sidewall: Flex Walls (Urethane sidewalls instead of standard ABS, bonds more effectively to core for more durable and damp construction)
base: Ultra Glide S (premium 7000-grade sintered base, ultra-dense P-tex for elite performance, durability, and maximum glide)
additional inserts - backseat +4: Extra inserts behind standard top inserts to move front foot back further, narrowing stance or shifting entire stance back
additional inserts - backseat +2: Extra inserts 4cm behind standard bottom inserts for moving bindings further back, ideal for deep powder float
terrain: Powder, Park, Groomers
